+`.env` uses the usual dotenv syntax: `KEY=value`, optional single or double quotes around the value, an optional leading `export `, and `#` comment lines. Inside double quotes, `\"` and `\\` are unescaped; inside single quotes, backslashes are kept as written. A ` #` after an unquoted value starts a comment.
